<title>UK: TABLE-Granada H1 profit tops forecasts.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Granada H1 profit tops forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to March 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) diluted    19.1		   vs 18.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.66		   vs 4.235</p>
<p> Pretax		     243.0		  vs 183.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,029.9		vs 1,511.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 235.0 and 240.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Above results exclude exceptionals. Including an exceptional gain, current H1 pretax profit was 265.8 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Granada Group Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
